SASS and ptxas -v reports of single kernels, compiled compile-only on dgx
with CUDA 13.4 (nvcc -cubin -arch=TARGET -O3 -Xptxas -v; cuobjdump -sass),
2026-10-28. No kernel here ran on a device.

gemm.*        llama_pf_post_t2, an e-graph prefill GEMM (Llama-3-8B emit,
              examples/nvidia/llama-infer -egraph-emit) using mma.sync BF16
nvfp4.*       ep_expert_t1, an e-graph NVFP4 MoE expert GEMM that decodes
              E2M1 to BF16 in registers before mma.sync
umma_bf16.*   umma_bf16_decode, tcgen05.mma kind::f16 (nvl72-tcgen05 lane)
umma_nvfp4.*  umma_nvfp4_decode, tcgen05.mma kind::mxf4nvf4.block_scale

The SASS keeps one function per file; encoding words are dropped and
operand spacing collapsed.
